            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 1–10</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>Getting a job with an airline</strong></div><p class=\"sub-head\"><strong>Example</strong></p><p>Job: cabin crew <u>attendant</u></p><p>Duties include</p><ul><li>giving the safety demonstration</li><li>some responsibility for {{1}} from sales during the flight</li><li>serving food</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Requirements</p><ul><li>must be over age 19 and at least {{2}} cm tall</li><li>basic academic requirements: English and {{3}}</li><li>at least one other {{4}} is desirable</li><li>must be able to {{5}}</li></ul><p>Training will include</p><ul><li>what to do in case of {{6}} during a flight</li><li>awareness of different {{7}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Application</p><ul><li>the airline is called {{8}}</li><li>can download application form from website</li><li>mention experience of: <ul><li>dealing with questions from supermarket customers</li><li>working in a {{9}} (voluntary work)</li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Other information</p><ul><li>you don't have to buy a {{10}}</li></ul></div>",
            "maxWords": 1
          }
        ]
      },
